title: "Time Series Explorer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ferrucci"
    given-names: "Franco"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4065-5944"
    affiliation: "GEPASUD Laboratory, University of French Polynesia, Tahiti, French Polynesia"
version: 0.3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ferrucci-franco/timeseries-explorer"
url: "https://www.unditas.com/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Browser and desktop application to explore time series locally: MATLAB .mat
  (including OpenModelica and Dymola results), CSV, Excel, Parquet, netCDF,
  pandas pickle, Micro-Cap and audio files, with time, frequency, distribution,
  correlation and phase-space views. Files are processed on the user's computer
  and never uploaded.
keywords:
  - time series
  - data visualization
  - Modelica
  - OpenModelica
  - simulation results
  - signal processing
